* Editing a cell auto-resizes it in "real-time"

* For table layout changes, you must press TAB with 
the cursor touching a table line dash (-)

* Table layout change intentions are done writing 
dashes (-) or pipes (|) touching existing table lines (-)

* To create a single cell table, write |- and press TAB 

* To create a multi cell table write |RxC and press TAB (R is the number of rows and C is the number of columns). For example |3x5 will create
a table with 3 rows and 5 columns. 